Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:40:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 39/46] fix(service): honour the selected PBS server and
 compression (issue #2)

The /backup route passed req.PBSID as the compression level and the level as
the PBS id, and the service's StartBackup ignored the PBS id anyway (always
the default server). Swap the arguments, resolve the server with
resolveBackupPBS like StartMachineBackup, and pass the selected server from the
split-backup path too. Regression test on the route.

The stuck "Starting backup..." of issue #2 (v0.3.0: service progress never
reached the GUI, status bar auto-hid mid-run) is fixed by upstream's progress
dispatch and persistent status; noted in the changelog.
